000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    TQ7SUBB.
      *C
      *C  09/13/1996    CA YODER
      *C    MODIFIED PROGRAM FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
